            "reason": "In the Ge'ez patristic citation ('ህየንተ ፡ አሐዱ ፡ ሠላሳ ፡ ወስሳ ፡ ወምእተ'), 'ሠላሳ' (thirty, matching L11 'ሠላሳ፡ ስሳ ፡ መቶ') has a faded central stroke on 'ሠ' that made it look like 'ወ'."
          }
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወስሳ ፡ ወምእተ ፡ እንዲል ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
