          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ ፡ ሉቃ ፡ ፳፩ ፥ ፲፱ ። ዕብ ፡ ፲ ፥ ፴፮ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": "፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፰ ፤ ተዐገሡኬ ፡ አንትሙ ፡ ወአጽንዑ ፡ ልበክሙ ፡⟫",
